msgstr "完全免费替换DOOM II——32级与超级猎枪. 与社区PWAD Mods兼容."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3177
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A complete free replacement for Quake — original levels, art, and music under BSD license."
msgstr "在BSD许可下完全免费替换Quake——原始关卡,艺术,和音乐."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:2976
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM — 4 episodes, 36 levels with original art and music."
msgstr "完全免费替换Ultimate DOOM——4集,36级配原创艺术和音乐."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:3091
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A cyberpunk DOOM total conversion with new weapons, enemies, and levels. Standalone v1.2 IWAD."
msgstr "网络PUNK DOOM完全转换 与新武器,敌人,和水平。 独立 v1.2 IWAD."

