"变体、Block Breakers、Hex Warlords、Hex Raid 变体、Hex Outlaw 变体、Hex Tennis 变体、Hex "
"Invaders 变体、Hex Enduro 变体、Hex Skiing 变体、Hex Frost 变体和 Hex Hockey 变体已可用。"

